      "parameters": {
        "content": "## DG · Build\n**Purpose**: build the issue 2 h before sending (DG-2…DG-4, DG-7): approved email blocks of the period + relevant external topics (feed items rewritten as blocks), subject / preheader / intro / order from AI, HTML from the template; fewer than 2 blocks -> skipped; else the card with approve / test send / preview goes to editors.\n**Input**: job {payload.issue_id}.\n**AI**: digest.feed_block, digest.compose.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
